<title>UK: European precious metals end quiet day mostly down.</title>
<headline>European precious metals end quiet day mostly down.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $319.30/$319.80 up 10 cents. Recovered from lower New York close early on physical and Asian buying. No momentum thereafter.</p>
<p>SILVER - Finished at $4.20/$4.22 down nine cents. Little interest after funds sold down in New York Wednesday.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Down $3.50/$4.50 at $401.50/$404.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Ended off $0.75 at $175.00/$179.00.</p>
</text>
